{"4725570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Elsewhere", "steam_appid": 4725570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725570/extras/a878ace00f22f6525c949354bec3f0a9.avif?t=1779343064\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725570/extras_big/a878ace00f22f6525c949354bec3f0a9.webp?t=1779343064 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a world you must go to when you grow up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one knows why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Because that's what adults do.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anne is 14. She's not an adult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But she's going anyway. <i>Because her brother is there!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725570/extras/20cbd11e379b939d276ade11a874f5ed.poster.avif?t=1779343064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725570/extras/20cbd11e379b939d276ade11a874f5ed.webm?t=1779343064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725570/extras/20cbd11e379b939d276ade11a874f5ed.mp4?t=1779343064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world where only adults belong. Alone. Forward.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725570/extras/0be